# The attack trigger of Super-Soldier Serum targets Bot1's Skullclamp; in response Bot2 sacrifices Cathar Commando to destroy
# the enchanted Ornithopter (an artifact creature). "It", the creature the Equipment is to be attached to, is gone when the
# trigger resolves, so nothing is attached (CR 701.3b): Skullclamp stays unattached. The Serum goes to the graveyard with the
# creature (CR 704.5m).

